  "Clément\," a powerful account of the incest he and his brothers endur
 ed for years. He will receive the title of Doctor Honoris Causa from ULB
  on September 18th. Thomas Prédour created the show "It Was Just a Game
 \," from which he developed a self-published book that also addresses th
 e theme of incest. They will discuss together the reasons that led them 
 to write on this subject and will read passages...\nhttps://chechette.be
 /events/11h-rencontre-litteraire-avec-romain-lemire-et-thomas-predour/
